flowchart LR
    accTitle: Agent orchestration and multi-agent patterns
    accDescr: A flowchart showing how tasks are classified, routed to specialist agents, executed with independent review, and assembled into a final response.

    H[Human request] --> R[Router agent]
    R --> |classify intent| D{Decision}
    D --> |build| C[Coder agent]
    D --> |review| RV[Reviewer agent]
    D --> |investigate| I[Investigator agent]
    D --> |operate| O[Operator agent]
    C --> W[Work output]
    RV --> W
    I --> W
    O --> W
    W --> IR[Independent reviewer]
    IR --> |approve| A[Assembled response]
    IR --> |revise| C
    A --> H2[Human receives result]
